## Interface: 16001
## Title: Azeroth Atlas
## Notes: Shows the local 3D map where you are (a tiny coded strip in a corner of the game window; /atlas turns it on or off), shows the 3D map's routes in the game (on the world map and minimap, as an arrow and as a list of steps), and follows leveling guides written for Guidelime in a window of its own (/atlas guide). Shift-click the world map for a quick waypoint. Options: Esc > Options > AddOns.
## Version: 18
## Group: AzerothAtlas
## OptionalDeps: ShortestPathForever, QuestieDB
## SavedVariables: AzerothAtlasDB
